          "requirement": "Call json_tokener_parse_ex repeatedly on the same tokener with successive chunks of a number so the retained number state is reconstructed.",
          "target_route": "Create a tokener; pass [0, then e+, then 1] as three successive parse_ex calls; release any result and free the tokener.",
          "failure_condition": "The old entry always creates a fresh tokener and makes one parse_ex call, so the changed nonempty-buffer reconstruction is unreachable for every generated input.",
